meta {
  name: upload-images
  type: http
  seq: 2
}

post {
  url: {{host}}/api/upload/images
  body: multipartForm
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{token}}
}

body:multipart-form {
  images: @file(path/to/image1.jpg)
  images: @file(path/to/image2.jpg)
}

docs {
  # Upload Multiple Images
  
  ## API Endpoint
  `POST /api/upload/images`
  
  **Auth Required:** ✅  
  **Role Required:** All authenticated users
  
  ---
  
  ## DTO (Request Body - multipart/form-data)
  
  ```typescript
  interface UploadImagesDTO {
    images: File[]; // Required - Multiple image files (max 10)
  }
  ```
  
  | Field | Type | Required | Validation |
  |-------|------|----------|------------|
  | images | File[] | ✅ | Max 10 files, jpg/jpeg/png/gif/webp |
  
  ---
  
  ## Response Structure
  
  ### Success (200)
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "message": "2 gambar berhasil diupload",
    "data": [
      {
        "filename": "image-1705312800000-abc123.jpg",
        "url": "/uploads/image-1705312800000-abc123.jpg",
        "mimetype": "image/jpeg",
        "size": 102400
      },
      {
        "filename": "image-1705312800001-def456.png",
        "url": "/uploads/image-1705312800001-def456.png",
        "mimetype": "image/png",
        "size": 204800
      }
    ]
  }
  ```
  
  ---
  
  ## Error Responses
  
  | Status | Message |
  |--------|--------|
  | 400 | File tidak ditemukan |
  | 400 | Maksimal 10 file |
  | 400 | Format file tidak didukung |
  | 401 | Token tidak valid |
  | 400 | Ukuran file terlalu besar. Maksimal 5MB per file |
}
